  "evidence": "TEXT_E: Save and modernise the NHS (treat 100,000 extra patients, public health drive, tobacco ad ban); Education first (smaller infant classes, universal nursery places, literacy/numeracy targets, wire schools to the internet); Incorporate the European Convention on Human Rights and enact a Freedom of Information Act; A sensibly set National Minimum Wage via a Low Pay Commission and promote the EU Social Chapter; Cut VAT on fuel to 5%; ethical, development-led foreign policy and a 20% CO2 reduction target. TEXT_C: Independence as the central goal (“normal nationhood,” majority of SNP MPs triggers negotiations, referendum to ratify); Scottish Defence Forces, removal of Trident, phased NATO withdrawal; A written constitution and Bill of Rights guaranteeing housing, education, healthcare, decent work and a minimum wage; NHS rebuilt with added funding and public‑health measures; anti‑poverty measures (raise Child Benefit, restore benefits for 16–17s, Pensioners’ Package).",
